--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
--	File: Appsrv.upg
--
--	Purpose: Script to upgrade database objects up to current version.
--
--		The script is organized according to:
--		[x.y.z]  (version to upgrade from)
--		SQL-statements to upgrade from versions x.y.z to x1.y1.z1
--		[x1.y1.z1] =(version to upgrade to)
--		SQL-statements
--		...
--		[xn.yn.zn] (last line always states current version)
--
-- 	NOTE Folder separator '/' used for compatibility with Unix. Works in Windows.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[4.0.0]
[4.1.0]
[5.0.0]
[21.1.0]
[21.2.0]
[22.1.0]
[22.2.0]
[23.1.0]
[23.2.0]
[24.1.0]
[24.2.0]
[25.1.0]
